{"3353700": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Card Collection Simulator", "steam_appid": 3353700, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Card Collection Simulator</strong> brings a deeper slice of the convention booth and personal collection aspects that surround real life card collecting. You'll open card packs on a virtual stream with your chat celebrating (or feeling your pain), sell or trade those cards at the convention, send in your rarest cards to be graded, design and build your personal collection room, and fill your collection the way you want!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Run your own Booth:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Head to the local Convention to sell your Cards, then buy Packs for more fun on Stream! Will you only sell duplicate Cards or will you part with the most valuable pieces of your Collection?   <br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3353700/extras/15ed0cb9e15d8f4210774cc5a706f039.avif?t=1784882316\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3353700/extras_big/15ed0cb9e15d8f4210774cc5a706f039.webp?t=1784882316 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Grow Your Stream:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every day you can open Card Packs on Stream, and your growing Community will share the excitement with you! Interact with them to gain more followers and unlock new rewards!<br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3353700/extras/3d154f0dbdc7206434906bfe814f6929.avif?t=1784882316\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3353700/extras_big/3d154f0dbdc7206434906bfe814f6929.avif?t=1784882316 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Collect Them All!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Card Collection Simulator has hundreds of unique Cards to collect! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Three separate Trading Card Games: </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Alienmon</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Heroes vs Villains</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cheopets</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each TCG comes with different Packs and Cards of various Rarities! Can you collect them all? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3353700/extras/80548a026c03f08b4c2685067d9a7760.avif?t=1784882316\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3353700/extras_big/80548a026c03f08b4c2685067d9a7760.webp?t=1784882316 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Card Collection Simulator</strong> brings a deeper slice of the convention booth and personal collection aspects that surround real life card collecting. You'll open card packs on a virtual stream with your chat celebrating (or feeling your pain), sell or trade those cards at the convention, send in your rarest cards to be graded, design and build your personal collection room, and fill your collection the way you want!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Run your own Booth:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Head to the local Convention to sell your Cards, then buy Packs for more fun on Stream! Will you only sell duplicate Cards or will you part with the most valuable pieces of your Collection?   <br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3353700/extras/15ed0cb9e15d8f4210774cc5a706f039.avif?t=1784882316\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3353700/extras_big/15ed0cb9e15d8f4210774cc5a706f039.webp?t=1784882316 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Grow Your Stream:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every day you can open Card Packs on Stream, and your growing Community will share the excitement with you! Interact with them to gain more followers and unlock new rewards!<br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3353700/extras/3d154f0dbdc7206434906bfe814f6929.avif?t=1784882316\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3353700/extras_big/3d154f0dbdc7206434906bfe814f6929.avif?t=1784882316 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Collect Them All!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Card Collection Simulator has hundreds of unique Cards to collect! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Three separate Trading Card Games: </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Alienmon</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Heroes vs Villains</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cheopets</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each TCG comes with different Packs and Cards of various Rarities! Can you collect them all? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3353700/extras/80548a026c03f08b4c2685067d9a7760.avif?t=1784882316\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3353700/extras_big/80548a026c03f08b4c2685067d9a7760.webp?t=1784882316 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p>", "short_description": "Become the world's greatest Card Collector! O